      <substacker:source>export</substacker:source>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>This post is written in Spanish on purpose. You don’t need to understand every word, just keep reading.</span></strong></p><p>Ya tenemos septiembre a la vuelta de la esquina. Y esto, para algunos, es una buena noticia… y para otros, no tan buena. 😅</p><div class="poll-embed" data-attrs="{&quot;id&quot;:1096833}" data-component-name="PollToDOM"></div><p>Vuelve la rutina, empieza a anochecer antes, se empiezan a caer las hojas de los árboles y ya hace falta una chaqueta por las noches. 🧥</p><p>También llegan los famosos <strong>propósitos de septiembre</strong>: estudiar, volver al gimnasio, aprender español, empezar un nuevo proyecto, comer más sano…</p><p>Porque para muchas personas, <strong>septiembre es cuando realmente empieza el año</strong>, y no enero.</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FPHQ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff06287d9-c9a6-4752-802b-290b53fe8e3a_2016x1134.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FPHQ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff06287d9-c9a6-4752-802b-290b53fe8e3a_2016x1134.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FPHQ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff06287d9-c9a6-4752-802b-290b53fe8e3a_2016x1134.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FPHQ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff06287d9-c9a6-4752-802b-290b53fe8e3a_2016x1134.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FPHQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff06287d9-c9a6-4752-802b-290b53fe8e3a_2016x1134.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f06287d9-c9a6-4752-802b-290b53fe8e3a_2016x1134.jpeg" width="1456" height="819" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f06287d9-c9a6-4752-802b-290b53fe8e3a_2016x1134.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:819,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:278659,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/i/213164455?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff06287d9-c9a6-4752-802b-290b53fe8e3a_2016x1134.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FPHQ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff06287d9-c9a6-4752-802b-290b53fe8e3a_2016x1134.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FPHQ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff06287d9-c9a6-4752-802b-290b53fe8e3a_2016x1134.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FPHQ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff06287d9-c9a6-4752-802b-290b53fe8e3a_2016x1134.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FPHQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff06287d9-c9a6-4752-802b-290b53fe8e3a_2016x1134.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Y aquí viene una expresión interesante 👇</p><p>En inglés decimos <strong>“I can’t wait…”</strong>, pero en español no decimos <em>“no puedo esperar”</em> cuando queremos expresar ilusión o ganas de que algo ocurra.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share Daily Push(es)&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share"><span>Share Daily Push(es)</span></a></p><p>Entonces, ¿cómo lo decimos?</p><p>👉 <strong>Tener ganas de…</strong></p><p><em>I can't wait to see you.</em><br>❌ <em>No puedo esperar para verte.</em><br>✅ <strong>Tengo ganas de verte.</strong><br>✅ <strong>Estoy deseando verte.</strong></p><p><strong>Ejemplos: </strong></p><ul><li><p>Tengo ganas de <strong>que se acabe el verano</strong></p></li><li><p>Tengo ganas de <strong>poder encender la chimenea</strong></p></li><li><p>Tengo ganas de <strong>viajar a Japón</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Tengo ganas de <strong>que llegue septiembre</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Tengo ganas de <strong>volver a la rutina</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Tengo ganas de <strong>retomar mis clases de español</strong>.</p></li></ul><p>Por cierto, si estás pensando en retomar o empezar tus clases de español este septiembre, quizá este sea tu momento 😉</p><p>Te dejo aquí toda la información sobre las <a href="https://dailypush.es/bookings/">clases de español</a> </p><div class="dynamic-content-block" data-dynamic-content="true" data-attrs="{&quot;audiences&quot;:[&quot;free_sub&quot;],&quot;displayName&quot;:&quot;Audience-specific content block&quot;,&quot;subscriberTagIds&quot;:null}" data-dynamic-audiences="free_sub"><div class="dynamic-content-match" data-dynamic-content-match="true"><h3>Bonus: ¿Te has dado cuenta…</h3><p>de que en los ejemplos, algunas frases van con <strong>infinitivo</strong> y otras con <strong>subjuntivo</strong>?</p><p>Vamos a practicarlo. Completa las frases con la forma correcta del verbo.</p><ol><li><p>Tengo ganas de __________ (pasar) más tiempo al aire libre.</p></li><li><p>Tengo ganas de que mi vecina __________ (vender) su casa.</p></li><li><p>Tengo ganas de que mis alumnos __________ (hablar) español con fluidez.</p></li><li><p>Tengo ganas de que las obras de mi calle __________ (terminar).</p></li><li><p>Tengo ganas de __________ (comer) churros con chocolate.</p></li><li><p>Tengo ganas de que __________ (parar) los incendios.</p></li><li><p>Tengo ganas de __________ (hacer) una escapada de fin de semana.</p></li><li><p>Tengo ganas de __________ (apuntarme) a clases de inglés.</p></li><li><p>Tengo ganas de que __________ (empezar) la temporada de conciertos.</p></li><li><p>Tengo ganas de __________ (tener) más tiempo para leer.</p></li></ol><p>Escribe tus respuestas y te las corrijo. </p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/cant-for-summer-to-end/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/cant-for-summer-to-end/comments"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p></div><div class="dynamic-content-else" data-dynamic-content-else="true"><div class="subscription-widget-wrap-editor" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}" data-component-name="SubscribeWidgetToDOM"><div class="subscription-widget show-subscribe"><div class="preamble"><p class="cta-caption">Thanks for reading Daily Push(es)! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.</p></div><form class="subscription-widget-subscribe"><input type="email" class="email-input" name="email" placeholder="Type your email…" tabindex="-1"><input type="submit" class="button primary" value="Subscribe"><div class="fake-input-wrapper"><div class="fake-input"></div><div class="fake-button"></div></div></form></div></div></div></div><p><strong>Y tú, ¿de qué tienes ganas?</strong><br>Cuéntamelo en los comentarios 👇</p><p><span>One last thing 😊</span></p><p><span>If you enjoyed this article, I’d be incredibly grateful if you tapped the ❤️ below.</span></p><p><span>¡Hasta la semana que viene!</span></p><p><span>Myriam</span></p><p></p>]]></content:encoded>
